title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf gui progress
catalog: CLI command
target: mf gui progress
summary: Report progress for the running script (updates its task-bar entry)

!! Reference

```
Report progress for the running script (updates its task-bar entry)

Usage: mf gui progress [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --done <DONE>
          Items processed so far (drives a determinate bar with --total)

      --total <TOTAL>
          Total items to process

      --phase <PHASE>
          Short label for the current step (e.g. the file being processed)

      --task <TASK>
          Run id (default: the METAFOLDER_GUI_TASK the GUI injected)

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
